#: scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9643fcc88175542814087374c0eeb8df93601a4be5ed0b51b38813da92cc7578
#. default-sha256: 7a49bf1342882cad6a6bfb83f09e23cb8cfa1b575ad71a22237222c4db47ff80
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The next day, I awoke with a "
"terrible fever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Le jour suivant, je me réveillai "
"avec une terrible fièvre."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69dd9d312d13b18ee0dbc74403b3296c22b9810780339756deea64f67c8c210d
#. default-sha256: a3f976f131bae5c4aefc398d2b14f1e5bec896edcc943f25a02b830a48c747eb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hovered in a sweltering wave of heat, unable to tell dream and reality apart, listening to "
"a seemingly endless stream of cracking noises."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une vague de chaleur accablante me terrassait et j’étais incapable de distinguer le rêve de "
"la réalité : je me retrouvai à écouter des bruits de craquements qui semblaient interminables."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50989d0040f1d2d2ee888d782705c5db455b24871672beaaa49a9d8fab148ee0
#. default-sha256: 42ab560116b96ba60cc21b3393cfa84ecb0d312fe6ab675f70714fd0d59f3b74
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sounds were coming from inside my body.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I thought I was falling apart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les bruits provenaient de mon corps.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’avais l’impression de me disloquer."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6d5f7c4a4734887a0e4fd8cd5c78f3ac5b43f836f5ac92fd355a441b80c850a
#. default-sha256: a4ef3bb843fad2954e39efd0445fcb1b0d1d6f9a7ead5fb50be469e2001c60ce
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother was horribly worried."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mère était horriblement inquiète."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55cae87dcd66faa196725c2a08177b430526f23641cfc79d426477d228012053
#. default-sha256: f0eb3dfbc6845c01a3b0540afad213e1bfa046afdd3c366d0dc6385c52189e38
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never been the most healthy child, but I had never fallen this ill either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je n’avais jamais été en très bonne santé mais je n’avais jamais été aussi malade non plus."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c511c1599e8f203b508e30d7831ee6f082169c915ae029b73df6954a1f548b72
#. default-sha256: 418c9b0d63453adf181444fb3e7fdce4b8b93d47b3efde1fe1d54207bfcb2f9d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t get out of bed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My voice was raspy, like an old woman’s.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I was "
"genuinely afraid I would wither away and die."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne pouvais sortir du lit.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma voix était rauque, comme celle d’une vieille femme."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫J’avais vraiment peur de dépérir et de mourir."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2dfa4b8bb543f15423a6f9ed9de17cda9392fd646bd83c35c896db4af6c61c3b
#. default-sha256: 46ccbbabef25e0eba963daac13fc76c7899885ef5a0a15e98b833b6bb824b676
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother called in doctor after doctor to see me, but they all said it was the flu."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mère appelait médecin sur médecin à mon chevet, mais ils disaient tous que c’était la grippe."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0458dcc28578dfeecccc75fa1e4c3f5a224fdc348bd72dea114827bc3724d85
#. default-sha256: 2383a0426d5730ea0f14f138c2120a69fe43c6691444a6596e53837ca356fff2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That bodily pain was common with a fever."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Que la souffrance physique accompagnait souvent la fièvre."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cff29735f95e75dbc610ed985d14c9befabdce86d3c17e0a0e676287141f3ef0
#. default-sha256: d2a660bc2a0d8090f899f80b07a4a1eb7d0212e34720294c78b23f6d64fae6fc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫While there was a doctor in the house, Mother was able to remain relatively calm,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tant qu’il y avait un médecin dans la maison, Mère arrivait à rester relativement calme,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d8469a22314f8549f6b6666e65d53e5b3466d8796a0aeadd982b297b8bc014d
#. default-sha256: 494235ccb05f08730c199db5482c667ecd7ad15bfec41e8743374d7c51a9e43a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but once they were gone, the anxiety came back. ⟪k:1⟫She stayed with me, day and night, even "
"foregoing sleep."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫mais une fois qu’ils étaient partis, son anxiété revenait. ⟪k:1⟫Elle me veillait nuit et "
"jour et renonçait même à dormir."

#: scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 989dd3e9fe940c69c8bca350e77339e1501549b19f8642e57aea20e6b3ff151a
#. default-sha256: d3375cb5d3c359d87025fca70f925504d026717466d2f2f3548ccee47f8e0a1a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her hands gripped mine. They held me fast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ses mains agrippaient les miennes. Elle les tenait fermement."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f2e75a031e5dc98ca612620aca2a18b4294f75be31c3809a597e9d85bd1fa4a
#. default-sha256: 6494b495f81e235390ac76f70a9384882866068bfe5ecea302422b6180c7c3fb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had her head bowed, as if in prayer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle avait la tête penchée, comme pour prier."

#: scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c09b5cfd18231e11d19b5ab72291b4eb138da420843b56531dfa2f7f6968c8b5
#. default-sha256: 9be91eb575aae29f7ae0908009e8db209c52317e08c9a67a4d54ff9f74f7e09e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Don’t worry... ⟪k:1⟫It’ll be all right, Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫God is watching over you... ⟪k:4⟫"
"He will protect you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ne t’en fais pas... ⟪k:1⟫Tout ira bien, Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dieu veille sur toi... ⟪k:4⟫Il te "
"protègera..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1193fe5b7dec483818968d7e6e17e767124963b418c583b3437211be673f3b78
#. default-sha256: f5ff9c868f63907d999ec81cbbed0bc0158927d1676bcc481af039c9250dd213
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You are His child...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You are His angel sent to Earth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tu es Son enfant...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu es Son ange envoyé sur Terre..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5051af8ac57860d0d3f6a2e77fce4c8f3ffbb11767b1af49d824ed103b66aea
#. default-sha256: 1ee1fd2b5cf5ca54839f1ea6321af28abaa7c4393f52e145278184bf0c3b573a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He will not forsake you...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The doctors say it’s just the flu..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il ne t’abandonnera pas...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Les médecins disent que c’est juste la grippe..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 932e4160fb3bd0d5cb150c60985b506bdac79a3c789a808171d2975a019c2fc9
#. default-sha256: fea02bcb692e66db5c76a903e5819ad999a10727134188d2e0f2c0298ccf89da
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though her words seemed to be directed at me, there was a vacantness in her voice, as if "
"they were really for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ses paroles m’étaient dirigées en apparence, mais sa voix sonnait creux, comme si elle se "
"parlait en réalité à elle-même."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a88ccd4587516f2d32b378801d69091dbf8a6d66e95414ee6c98ab4c55a32084
#. default-sha256: a510dc8b7cb658908a6b025a38a0225a8ccaed776a7688d652f1cb894dc3cffc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For so long, she had wanted a daughter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pendant si longtemps, elle avait voulu une fille."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00e46dc4eb7a77848e7860f6e57b5839155ece5ab3b86f936e5e69b8f3fa3622
#. default-sha256: 9c4af8e5c7d6cfa8f2bb60411f8871389989f233feac616eb366b70dc228cd32
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t understand her fixation,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne comprenais pas son obsession,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7adac9e0082e54fd588bc1020e4fdacaa04af085b5692b108cee22c4a2dc2a77
#. default-sha256: 14cc87e3e0ce376e7582ccebe6d43e0209d7132adaeac9fa541b27c96feb7944
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but seeing her there through my cloudy eyes, I wanted to apologize for ever thinking "
"spending time with her was agonizing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫mais à la voir, là, à travers mes yeux brumeux, je voulais lui demander pardon d’avoir pensé "
"qu’il m’était pénible de passer du temps avec elle."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6052f2557a59055f6202a1c3508165b97fc18a590e47403c1cefd304772eb416
#. default-sha256: c4867ae6e64718e7425c0bc42866a1ade2e6aca20fbefb101d3b9c74706ca2a9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How are you feeling?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Your mother’s here for you. Don’t worry."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comment te sens-tu ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ta mère est là pour toi. Ne t’inquiète pas."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd7a0ac04b71e778feaf142c73433be04febabbb6b5acdf51030105ba8c8888c
#. default-sha256: ee1d7185300efdcf3fd3014faf57c9558b167424c45663e050fb68bfc1a8b346
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the only sound that came from my mouth was a faint gasp."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais le seul son qui parvint à franchir la barrière de mes lèvres fut un léger souffle."

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a857e598572481b8592d0d737837c47c7fe2617d1a4899d0c475b0e2d7959472
#. default-sha256: cc1332c93da79d0f6dc380d3d4defedc4c89b4d41212bdd7e6964c9889a6d9a7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I drifted in and out of sleep, Mother’s hand wrapped around my own."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je passais mon temps à dormir et j’en émergeais de temps à autre ; la main de Mère ne me "
"quittait jamais."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b063f34f4ae854baca159f9e4fd778b516da8d4ca086e2fdeae1160462c6afc
#. default-sha256: 52a6f18b5eaeb6f4b262098229d2df8339f9d547a353eaffa07b6b19eed6c798
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I had numerous dreams."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et je faisais de nombreux rêves."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd34bb5283947ed64ee9b4efce38ab0304acb68a3d724c9157153318fe475f3d
#. default-sha256: 3573766110552bb0bc6e5dbdd8f71500b5a8ba3f0afe730b0922fd1f06621e89
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was a man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dans mes rêves, j’étais un homme."

#: scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4037efbb490eaa00c6b6420616e884162e38ea86e4191b8a748f84be65a1023f
#. default-sha256: c2514d18a0489e0d03b183173032794ca55d3b7ee959fcf5ab17b9d89a4b7080
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was Didier and I was Georges."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dans mes rêves, j’étais Didier et j’étais Georges."

#: scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03a76a86a9b50e0e3a71566bb043b64eb170b476c584a25043e6cf67e65ce1d2
#. default-sha256: 6603d6b67770d8074164225992940dbaa0241f94569d6ed0fb54cb9b7c23d676
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I fell in love with Aimee,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dans mes rêves, l’amour envers Aimée m’envahissait,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3D45B051_380A_4FD6_96A7_200F6F0BFD4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8411e226bcdf5d68538793776bb2886a615f6bef94165357c98a7523c0460aef
#. default-sha256: 9a72e533cf06cdad2a24d845e26e38073b371bbf747c24f4f8f565bae350ea57
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3D45B051_380A_4FD6_96A7_200F6F0BFD4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and in my dreams, I loved her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫et dans mes rêves, je l’aimais."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1A60B55F_1C1C_4AD1_8561_832959556D49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1f722bcb92d284888352f0941ad8a5e67d8413bc836cd25a4ced145c84afae0
#. default-sha256: e726f5f3aa46b0a45191d5cb75d0541cc988f984052898a77de8185b8f4e4241
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1A60B55F_1C1C_4AD1_8561_832959556D49"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re disgusting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu me dégoûtes."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9495A7DD_8CBA_48AE_A956_46AAABF77D9A
